      522.89,
      397.18,
      558.83
    ],
    "text": "(i)to take necessary steps to promote artistic creations,sport skills and technical knowledge of schoolleavers and set up vocational training centers;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
